event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":93,"item_id":"rs_024509fd3b1981ca016ac92de6ab048194934deede7a77fb39","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing API tests**\n\nI need to set up a small server for a static client API using SQLite for persistence. First, I'll create a default database at the location `data/workboard.sqlite`. For the HTML client, I want to ensure simple navigation and full page load with client requests. Security is key, particularly regarding text content. I’ll also run tests using Node to spawn a temporary health API and check the pages. It’s important to set appropriate limits too!"}

